SCENE BREAKDOWN (15 seconds)
SCENE 0 — Anchor (0.0–0.3s)

Slow dolly-in on the trio standing at the mouth of a narrow alley, fog curling upward around their legs. A villager collapses blurred in the background.

SCENE 1 — The Walk Begins (0.3–3.0s)

Low shot tracking their feet.
As they step, wood beams and doors nearby sprout black rot veins in fast timelapse.
Dust motes drift toward them instead of away.

SCENE 2 — Bystanders Falter (3.0–6.0s)

Side profile tracking.
Two villagers who were staring at them begin coughing violently, weakening instantly.
A linen banner above them decays into holes as their shadows glide beneath it.

SCENE 3 — Plague Doctors Freeze (6.0–9.0s)

Two plague doctors step into view.
Their masks warp subtly; eye lenses fog internally.
They try to approach but their bodies stiffen, trembling, paralyzed.
Close-up on the family’s serene, unbothered lenses dilating.

SCENE 4 — Contagion Wake (9.0–12.0s)

Tracking shot from behind the family.
The alley they leave behind descends into quiet collapse:
people slumping, rats fleeing, puddles turning black.

Fog streams toward the family’s backs like pulled by magnetism.

SCENE 5 — End Frame (12.0–15.0s)

Wide reveal of the medieval square they enter.
Smoke. Scattered bodies. Tolling bell.
They pause gracefully for half a second.

End text (small, bottom corner):
Some miracles walk among us.
Not all of them heal.